-- the default format of $dateToString: with Z in UTC, without it in another time zone
2024-03-09T23:30:00.123Z	2024-03-09T23:30:00.123Z	2024-03-09T18:30:00.123
-- a startOfWeek is ignored for a unit other than week
1709942400	1709942400
-- a whole amount is added, whether a literal or computed
1710199800	1710199800
-- what cannot be honoured is refused
Code: 48. The 'onNull' field of '$dateToString' is not supported
Code: 48. '$dateToString' without a 'format' needs a 'timezone' that is a string literal: whether the text ends with 'Z' depends on it
Code: 36. The 'amount' of '$dateAdd' must be a whole number
The 'amount' of '$dateSubtract' must be a whole number
